                                    <xs:documentation xml:lang="en-US">
                                        <osd:label>Proprietary Name Suffix</osd:label>
                                        <osd:description>A suffix to the proprietary name, a value here should be appended to the ProprietaryName field to obtain the complete name of the product. This suffix is often used to distinguish characteristics of a product such as extended release (“XR”) or sleep aid (“PM”). Although many companies follow certain naming conventions for suffices, there is no recognized standard.</osd:description>
